ly_within) instead of a rect centered at the eye: the bounding box of the eye and the part of the screen within the angle (augs::calc_sector_within_rect_aabb), 3 degrees of margin, the eye always 64 px from its bounds. With the minimap fog of war overlay on, the whole fog of war area is used as before. On de_jedrula by the portal (playtest, RX 5700, 1918x1060) the fow job was the critical path of the thread pool at 1.65 ms per frame, single-threaded, ~500 rays over a 5100x2900 px area of small wall tiles: now 0.29 ms, ~425 -> ~835 FPS. Compared with the full polygon on a grid of 8 px cells within the screen and the angle, 100 samples while walking and looking around (straight up, sideways, with the edge zoomout): at most 2 of 58140 cells differ (rounding at shadow edges).","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"kroxylicious/kroxylicious","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-19T16:05:22Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"38efadba7ee5f58ea0565ca80aefb81f47abe110","github_link":"https://github.com/kroxylicious/kroxylicious/commit/38efadba7ee5f58ea0565ca80aefb81f47abe110","commit_subject":"ci(sonar): post failed check when SonarCloud scans error (#5115)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ValidatorsDAO/slv","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-19T16:05:15Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"4a98bc007bff128d0ee4ce923c3310969570257c","github_link":"https://github.com/ValidatorsDAO/slv/commit/4a98bc007bff128d0ee4ce923c3310969570257c","commit_subject":"fix: a start or restart that would bring the node back on the staked identity stops; play variables and password salts are checked (#440)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"CodinGame/monaco-vscode-api","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-19T16:05:14Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"3d7b9e115088a08c6f42a552b9bf493a8439ab0f","github_link":"https://github.com/CodinGame/monaco-vscode-api/commit/3d7b9e115088a08c6f42a552b9bf493a8439ab0f","commit_subject":"fix: do not wait for the other stylesheets before adopting font faces","ai_tool":"Cursor"},{"repo_name":"ClickHouse/C